Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: gaokun3: avoid shared cluster collapse in EL2

On Gaokun3 with the EL2 boot flow, real s2idle resets the machine when
shared cluster collapse is available. The PMIC PON log records a PS_HOLD
hard reset. Freezer, device and late/noirq PM tests pass. Keeping either
CPU0 or CPU4 in WFI also lets real suspend resume successfully while the
other CPUs enter and exit the CPU-only PSCI state 0x40000004.

Removing the shared cluster's domain-idle-states property allows all eight
CPUs to use 0x40000004 without selecting cluster state 0x4100c344. This was
validated on 2026-10-24 with RTC wake and systemd suspend/power-button wake.
The firmware-internal reason for the PS_HOLD reset remains unidentified.

Use a Gaokun3 EL2 base wrapper so that the deletion is processed before
applying the common EL2 overlay. A compiled overlay cannot represent a
/delete-property/ operation against a property in its target base tree.
Keep the standard Gaokun3 DTB and other SC8280XP EL2 boards unchanged.

---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile                         | 2 +-
 .../dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-el2-base.dts          | 8 ++++++++
 2 files changed, 9 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/Makefile
@@ -294,3 +294,3 @@
-sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-el2-dtbs	:= sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dtb sc8280xp-el2.dtbo
+sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-el2-dtbs	:= sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-el2-base.dtb sc8280xp-el2.dtbo
 dtb-$(CONFIG_ARCH_QCOM)	+= sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dtb sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-el2.dtb
 sc8280xp-lenovo-thinkpad-x13s-el2-dtbs	:= sc8280xp-lenovo-thinkpad-x13s.dtb sc8280xp-el2.dtbo
diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-el2-base.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-el2-base.dts
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3-el2-base.dts
@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+// SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
+
+#include "sc8280xp-huawei-gaokun3.dts"
+
+&cluster_pd {
+	/* Shared cluster collapse resets Gaokun3 in the EL2 boot flow. */
+	/delete-property/ domain-idle-states;
+};
